# Optional cloud sync (Google Sign-In + Firestore).
#
# KanDOne is offline-first, and cloud sync works out of the box against the
# app's own Firebase project. Set a variable here only to override that value —
# point a fork or a preview deploy at your own project by setting all six.
#
# Get the values from the Firebase console: Project settings → Your apps → Web
# app. They are public client identifiers, not secrets — they ship in the
# client bundle by design. Access is controlled by firestore.rules and by
# Authentication → Authorized domains.
#
# Each variable falls back independently, so a partial set mixes projects —
# set all six or none.

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
